    "detailed_description": "<strong>MD_GAMES' first work!</strong><br><br>\u3010\u5e7d\u970a\u90e8\u54e1 -Ghost Member-\u3011  is a single-player ghost investigation horror adventure game.<br>You investigate ghosts in a house where a member of the occult research club who went missing was investigating.<br>The story progresses by using multiple items to find traces left by the ghost and identify the type of ghost.<br>Can you solve the safety of the missing members of the club ...... and the bizarre phenomena that occur one after another in this house ......<br>Enjoy this Japanese horror adventure!<br><br><strong>\u25a0Story</strong><br>A member of the occult research club went to a certain house to investigate a mysterious phenomenon, but then disappeared.<br>Other members of the club go to the house, but there is no one there. The club members start to investigate to find a clue...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200320/extras/7345664743fa395d6d92bf78cf060dbb.avif?t=1694849312\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u25a0characters </strong><br>\u30fbKento Narimitsu<br>He is also a gadget geek who specializes in modifying machines and tries to solve the mystery of ghosts with the power of machines.<br><br>\u30fbRiko Odawara<br>An honor student and miko (maiden) with a strong sports spirit.<br>She is a strong-willed person who tries to lead her club members, but she also has a kind heart and cares for others.<br><br>\u30fbTakeo Emoto<br>He is a nice guy with a rugged gentleness that shines through, although he has no inspiration at all.<br><br>\u30fbYuka Uebayashi<br>She has a great sense of inspiration and can always see ghosts.<br>She does not really want to be involved with ghosts, but her ability is bought and she joins the club.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200320/extras/a25ed18a856283d2ac721d4fe956f8c5.avif?t=1694849312\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u25a0About the live streaming</strong><br>We will allow you to broadcast your game regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation, or whether you are using a distribution platform.<br>Monetization of video distribution is also permitted.<br>Please do not use the game in a way that seriously damages the image of the game, is explicitly sexual in nature, or is offensive to public order and morals.<br>We hope you enjoy playing the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>MD_GAMES' first work!</strong><br><br>\u3010\u5e7d\u970a\u90e8\u54e1 -Ghost Member-\u3011  is a single-player ghost investigation horror adventure game.<br>You investigate ghosts in a house where a member of the occult research club who went missing was investigating.<br>The story progresses by using multiple items to find traces left by the ghost and identify the type of ghost.<br>Can you solve the safety of the missing members of the club ...... and the bizarre phenomena that occur one after another in this house ......<br>Enjoy this Japanese horror adventure!<br><br><strong>\u25a0Story</strong><br>A member of the occult research club went to a certain house to investigate a mysterious phenomenon, but then disappeared.<br>Other members of the club go to the house, but there is no one there. The club members start to investigate to find a clue...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200320/extras/7345664743fa395d6d92bf78cf060dbb.avif?t=1694849312\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u25a0characters </strong><br>\u30fbKento Narimitsu<br>He is also a gadget geek who specializes in modifying machines and tries to solve the mystery of ghosts with the power of machines.<br><br>\u30fbRiko Odawara<br>An honor student and miko (maiden) with a strong sports spirit.<br>She is a strong-willed person who tries to lead her club members, but she also has a kind heart and cares for others.<br><br>\u30fbTakeo Emoto<br>He is a nice guy with a rugged gentleness that shines through, although he has no inspiration at all.<br><br>\u30fbYuka Uebayashi<br>She has a great sense of inspiration and can always see ghosts.<br>She does not really want to be involved with ghosts, but her ability is bought and she joins the club.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200320/extras/a25ed18a856283d2ac721d4fe956f8c5.avif?t=1694849312\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u25a0About the live streaming</strong><br>We will allow you to broadcast your game regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation, or whether you are using a distribution platform.<br>Monetization of video distribution is also permitted.<br>Please do not use the game in a way that seriously damages the image of the game, is explicitly sexual in nature, or is offensive to public order and morals.<br>We hope you enjoy playing the game.",
